### Variables globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@tenantId = your_tenant_id
@token = your_token

### 1. Crear un nuevo tenant con usuario admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Tenant",
  "company_username": "test_company",
  "status": "active",
  "admin_username": "admin_test",
  "admin_first_name": "Admin",
  "admin_last_name": "Test",
  "admin_email": "admin@test.com",
  "admin_password": "Admin123!"
}

### 2. Login como admin (guarda el tenant_id y token de la respuesta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_test",
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 3. Probar permiso de creación en Employee Management (debería funcionar para admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/test-rbac/employee-management/test-create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Probar permiso de lectura en Farm (debería funcionar para admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-rbac/farm/test-read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Obtener todos los módulos accesibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-rbac/my-accessible-modules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Crear un nuevo usuario con roles limitados
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "limited_user",
  "first_name": "Limited",
  "last_name": "User",
  "email": "limited@test.com",
  "password": "Limited123!",
  "roles": ["Employee"]
}

### 7. Login como usuario limitado
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "limited_user",
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantId}}",
  "password": "Limited123!"
}

### 8. Probar permiso de creación en Employee Management (debería fallar para usuario limitado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/test-rbac/employee-management/test-create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Obtener módulos accesibles para usuario limitado
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-rbac/my-accessible-modules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}} 